 his charm on someone else. 🥰<br><br>I literally have nothing to say about either <b>Tess</b>, besides the unlucky coincidence of her being an annoyingly indecisive when it came to giving her vote of credit wench with violet eyes OR the plot that is a jumbled mess (tautology says hi) of incomprehensible alphas, omegas and betas I didn't give a single flying fuck about doing things (chasing, killing, abducting, selling, rutting, saving... I'm exasperated, you see) I had no interest in reading about. 👏🏻🤡<br><br>As far as I'm concerned, the relationship dynamics in romance needs to be riveting to keep my interest in anything besides it alive. Straightforward, obvious and safe from scratch?? MY NERVE CELLS WANT TO DIE A SLOW, AGONISING DEATH BEFORE THEY RESURRECT IN THE FACE OF satisfying HAPPILY EVER AFTER at the end. I didn't scream that last sentence, by the way. 🥰<br><br><img src="https://images.gr-assets.com/hostedimages/1630176755ra/31845923.gif" class="gr-hostedUserImg" loading="lazy"></span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/100476652?shelf=cardboard-characters" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">cardboard-characters</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/100476652?shelf=faithful-lovebirds" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">faithful-lovebirds</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/100476652?shelf=fated-mates" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">fated-mates</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span> <div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium" aria-label="Show all items in the list"><span class="Button__labelItem">...more</span></button></div></ul></section><foote