arge" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted"><img alt="" src="https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1623797361i/31496274._SY540_.jpg" class="gr-hostedUserImg" loading="lazy"><br><br>Savage Prince is book two in the Ruthless Warlords series by Alison Aimes. I’ve been in love with this series since the first book. These books take place in a parallel Alphaverse galaxy. It’s dark and dangerous. But these Skolov siblings have stolen my heart. This is Maxheim’s book.<br><br>Maxheim Skolov considers himself to be the “fixer” of the family. When there is a problem with any of his siblings, he solves it. His family’s safety is all that matters to him. And now, finding the long lost twins that were stolen from them when they were infants. Maxheim is cold, ruthless and completely driven. Now that his older brother is mated, he tries to take as much of the responsibility onto his own shoulders as he can. It’s on a mission, though, that everything changes. That he finds…her!!!<br><br><img alt="" src="https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1623797361i/31496275.jpg" class="gr-hostedUserImg" loading="lazy"><br><br>Tess is an omega slave. She has a rare and deadly gift and is forced to use it against her will. Her life is dismal and not worth living except that the other female slave’s survival rests on her shoulders. <br><br>In this world, every alpha has one fated mate, an omega made just for him. Some alphas avoid such a match because once you bond with your fated mate, everything else fades away. Your mate becomes the focus of your entire world, all that matters. Maxheim knows right away that he has found her and in that instant, his world is rearranged. She is his laser focus, her survival, her happiness, her pleasure. It’s all that matters. Only, for some reason, Tess doesn’t seem as willing to bond with him!<br><br><b>
  <i>“I will always find a way to light your way and keep you from the dark.”</i>
</b><br><br>Tess might be a tiny omega but she is strong and determined. She has never known anyone that wanted to care for her in the way Maxheim does. She struggles to trust that his motives are pure. Her survival instinct tells her to run. But her heart wants to believe that this could be real.<br><br><b>
  <i>“You are my compass and my road home, my foundation and my pinnacle, my beginning and my end, my heart and my soul.”</i>
</b><br><br>Tess and Maxheim are trying to adjust to being fated mates but at the same time, everything possible is threatening both them and Maxheim’s family. Of course, Maxheim wants to bear the entire burden on his own shoulders but Tess isn’t having it. <br><br><img alt="" src="https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1623797361i/31496276._SY540_.jpg" class="gr-hostedUserImg" loading="lazy"><br><br>This book, just as the previous book, keeps you on the edge of your seat from start to finish. I loved watching Maxheim evolve after finding Tess. He is so hard and cold but after he found Tess, he became absolutely swoony! These two together burned up the pages. I truly love this family and their commitment to each other, the way they interact. I never thought I would fall in love with a world like this one but I have and I can’t wait for the next book which will be Alexi’s book, Broken Heir. <br><br>For more about this book and so many others, come and visit me at Carol's Crazy Bookish World.<br><a target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow" href="https://www.facebook.com/groups/CarolsCrazyBookishWorld">https://www.facebook.com/groups/Carol...</a><br><br><img alt="" src="https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1502304251i/23548582.jpg" class="gr-hostedUserImg" loading="lazy"></span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/10717098?shelf=paranormal-fantasy" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">paranormal-fantasy</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">67 likes</span></button