 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></svg></span><span class="baseClass RatingStar--small"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" role="presentation"><path class="RatingStar__fill" d="M24 9.63469C24 9.35683 23.7747 9.13158 23.4969 9.13158H15.0892L12.477 1.34327C12.4269 1.19375 12.3095 1.0764 12.16 1.02625C11.8966 0.937894 11.6114 1.07983 11.523 1.34327L8.91088 9.13158H0.503157C0.33975 9.13158 0.186521 9.21094 0.0922364 9.3444C-0.0680877 9.57134 -0.0140806 9.88529 0.212865 10.0456L7.00408 14.8432L4.40172 22.6166C4.35092 22.7683 4.37534 22.9352 4.46749 23.066C4.6275 23.2932 4.94137 23.3476 5.16853 23.1876L12 18.3758L18.8317 23.183C18.9625 23.2751 19.1293 23.2994 19.281 23.2486C19.5445 23.1604 19.6865 22.8752 19.5983 22.6117L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3768668091">June 28, 2021</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">What a ride!!<br><br><img src="https://images.gr-assets.com/hostedimages/1624566936ra/31542960.gif" alt="Coaster GIFs - Get the best GIF on GIPHY" class="gr-hostedUserImg" loading="lazy"><br><br>Isn't lovely when a control freak loses control?<br><br><img src="https://images.gr-assets.com/hostedimages/1624566936ra/31542961.gif" alt="Losing My Mind Gif" class="gr-hostedUserImg" loading="lazy"><br><br>Oh sweet, uptight control freak Maxheim. I feel your pain, I too am the control freak of my family. Knowing the only reason everything isn't going to hell, is cause we're pulling all the strings tight keeping everything going and moving about how it should....Until we hit that unforeseen snag. <br><br><img src="https://images.gr-assets.com/hostedimages/1624566936ra/31542962.gif" alt="The Gif Wars. No Words. Just Gifs. Let's talk with images. - Page 438" class="gr-hostedUserImg" loading="lazy"><br><br>Nothing like finding your fated mate AND she's part of the syndicate killing brotherhood members you've been after. Like the MAIN killer and like super besties with the silver douche bag you've been searching for that kidnapped your twin brother and sister 15 years ago!! Yeah...<br><br><img src="https://images.gr-assets.com/hostedimages/1624566936ra/31542963.gif" alt="request ` Teen Wolf peter hale stevensrogers i love sassy!peter more than i love most things (i apologize about them all being so d a r k i tried my best" class="gr-hostedUserImg" loading="lazy"><br><br>Poor sweet Tesstala, 'Tess', was being exploited. Her sweet and compassionate heart was being being twisted and used against her. Her love and trusting nature was misplaced on the worst backstabbers surrounding her. Using her in ways she could never have comprehended. Until she's 'rescued' by her fated mate Maxheim, and he shows her a whole new way of living. <br><br>I loved how Maxheim gave himself over to his relationship with Tess and everything it would entail, entirely. 100%. He didn't care what might happen, he would make a way. He was so protective of Tess and wanting her to know what it is like to be pampered, treated as an equal, and treated with love.<br><br><blockquote>
  <b>
    <i>“Tess.” his grip tightened. “Love doesn’t even begin to cover what I feel for you. It’s relentless. Savage. Primitive. It’s breath and blood and life.”<br>Her heart trembled in her chest.<br>His grip tightened, scowl deepening. “So, don’t fucking ask me to give you up. I won’t.”</i>
  </b>
</blockquote><br><br><img src="https://images.gr-assets.com/hostedimages/1391571017ra/8412698.gif" alt="Jess-i-ca ~Sometimes a Gif Witch~ (Bossier City, LA)'s review of Ignite Me" class="gr-hostedUserImg" loading="lazy"><br><br>Tess, who's never had any notion of having what Maxheim is offering, is scared to let go and dive in because she's just waiting for the other shoe to drop and everything to be ripped away. <br><br><blockquote>
  <b>
    <i>I never thought I’d be one of the lucky ones. But that’s what it feels like.” She clutched her treasure closer. “That’s what it feels like to be yours"</i>
  </b>
</blockquote><br><br>Not to mention the 3 separate entities that are trying to steal her away and kill Maxheim and all the Skolovs. She knows that in life we rarely get what we want and love isn't always enough. <br><br><img src="https://images.gr-assets.com/hostedimages/1624569983ra/31543049.gif" alt="Shower Couple GIF - Shower Couple Hug - Discover &amp; Share GIFs" class="gr-hostedUserImg" loading="lazy"><br><br>The ups and downs in this one, the tension, had my emotions all over the place. I loved Maxheim and Tess. I loved how they each were what the other needed to break free from their shackles and live. How they gave each other the ability to let go and love, and have something for themselves. Maxheim and Tess fought and built trust, doing what it took to create that strong foundation for an unshakable future. And I must say, I love how I was pleasantly surprised by Maxheim. How he had forced Tess into a corner, and I thought oh I know how this is gonna go, he's forcing her hand she gonna go do what we all don't want her to do....but instead Maxheim, like a responsible adult man, went and got down on his knees and begged for Tess's forgiveness. <br><br><img src="https://images.gr-assets.com/hostedimages/1595643805ra/29860774.gif" alt="forgive me gifs | WiffleGif" class="gr-hostedUserImg" loading="lazy"><br><br>This was so good! It was emotional, suspenseful, and steamy as all get out. I can't recommend this series enough!!<br><br>Even though this is an ARC review, I will always shoot you straight. I received an ARC in exchange for an honest review.</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/93580497?shelf=amazing-sfr" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">amazing-sfr</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/93580497?shelf=arc" class="Butto