 happens next. Is the Sartin female Alexi's fated mate? Will they find their twin siblings? And who is this secret saboteur who has been pulling the strings and wreaking havoc on the Brotherhood, especially my beloved Skolovs?<br><br><b>Find more <a href="https://www.nbiblioholic.com/2022/03/review-savage-prince-by-alison-aimes.html" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">on the blog</a></b><br><br><img src="https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1647774741i/32708376._SX540_.jpg" class="gr-hostedUserImg" loading="lazy"></span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/39243185?shelf=aliens" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">aliens</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/39243185?shelf=dual-pov" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">dual-pov</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/39243185?shelf=fated-mates" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">fated-mates</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span> <div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium" aria-label="Show all items in the list"><span class="Button__labelItem">...more</span></button></div></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">19 likes</span></button></div><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">2 comments</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="Social