 22.9352 4.46749 23.066C4.6275 23.2932 4.94137 23.3476 5.16853 23.1876L12 18.3758L18.8317 23.183C18.9625 23.2751 19.1293 23.2994 19.281 23.2486C19.5445 23.1604 19.6865 22.8752 19.5983 22.6117L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></svg></span><span class="baseClass RatingStar--small"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" role="presentation"><path class="RatingStar__fill" d="M24 9.63469C24 9.35683 23.7747 9.13158 23.4969 9.13158H15.0892L12.477 1.34327C12.4269 1.19375 12.3095 1.0764 12.16 1.02625C11.8966 0.937894 11.6114 1.07983 11.523 1.34327L8.91088 9.13158H0.503157C0.33975 9.13158 0.186521 9.21094 0.0922364 9.3444C-0.0680877 9.57134 -0.0140806 9.88529 0.212865 10.0456L7.00408 14.8432L4.40172 22.6166C4.35092 22.7683 4.37534 22.9352 4.46749 23.066C4.6275 23.2932 4.94137 23.3476 5.16853 23.1876L12 18.3758L18.8317 23.183C18.9625 23.2751 19.1293 23.2994 19.281 23.2486C19.5445 23.1604 19.6865 22.8752 19.5983 22.6117L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4059124837">June 18, 2021</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted"><b>"I Choose You."</b><br />A Savage yet beautiful Addition to this epic series!<br /><b>An Unputdownable Sci-fi romance with Heart-pounding Action &amp; Danger, Sinfully Hot lust, Heartaching Hurts, Betrayal, Trust, Truths, Hope &amp; Healing, Vulnerable Emotions, Twists, Smarts, Drama &amp; Fun, Beautiful Swoons, Heartfelt Love, An Ingenious Showdown, A cherished HEA &amp; I'm Pumped up for More!</b><br />This book gripped me, made me feel it all. I love Maxheim &amp; Tess so much, Their Bravery strengthens me. I DEVOURED this in 8hrs, Alison you did it again!💘<br /><br /><i>This story takes place in Anarcheim, a parallel Alphaverse galaxy, With Varied Alien life. Alphas lead, betas serve, and omegas submit. Where violence is a way of life, power is essential to survival, and crime is king.</i><br />(Loving the World building &amp; Character Development!)<br /><br /><b>"They were two souls from very different worlds, twisted and remade by life’s challenges, who fit together perfectly."</b><br />Maxheim &amp; Tesstala both lived harsh lives. Max &amp; his Siblings only had eachother after a tragedy, grew from nothing to Mafia "Royalty". Tess is an orphan, captured. For years, her "Owner" abused her deadly omega power, &amp; She let's him, to keep her friends safe &amp; alive.<br /><b>"She might not know it yet, but she needed him. Just as he needed her."</b><br /><br /><b>"He was calculating and savage and unquestionably ruthless, but never cruel."</b><br />Maxheim Skolov (2nd eldest brother, Alpha) is the fixer (&amp; Inventor) of their family &amp; Empire. The Investigation/Search for enemy &amp; their long-lost twin Siblings' going on. This takes them to an illegal Auction, Where Tess is too. <i>Cue an uproar, Killer instinct, Undeniable Bond...Plans fractured &amp; remade, Their world forever realigned &amp; refocuses...On eachother.</i><br /><b>"Beautiful chaos. That’s what she was."</b><br /><br /><b>“...From you, I want what’s given, not seized. Earned, not stolen.”</b><br />Max+Tess are blazing fire, Sinful lust, Inevitable, Fated. But also...Enemies (Cue fun Banters!). <i>After all, She's friends to Rav, the one they're after, her Fellow slave.</i> But then they're targeted (F'ing Feds!), Dearest Betrayals &amp; Truths Found...Dangers bring them closer.<br /><b>"...this male, who should have been her enemy, kept being her ally and her anchor."</b><br /><br /><b>"He understood her needs and didn’t judge. His command truly was her pleasure, their interests aligned."</b><br />This story has NO dull moment, So Fast-paced! Their trust builds through adventures (Ooh, Death Squad!). She's cautious, but he's in for the long haul. <i>He Romances her, Breaks her walls; She Cares for him, Gentle &amp; Kickass!</i> Feelings grow, Attacks Escalate, Tension for future, Will they ever get to just BE?<br /><b>“What’s between us, baby. It’s the kind of light that will never dim.”</b><br /><br /><b>"She was his. And he was hers."</b><br />When the two finally get to Max's home planet, I adore how she's accepted by his family easily! I love that M+T get some down time, to let their Fated mate bond bind tighter (Doc gives fun insights!). Their Happiness, Fun &amp; Love Confessions so sweet❤.<br /><i>I'm glad that the Skolov bros open up to eachother😍, Plus the scenes with <a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3741791597" rel="nofollow noopener">Nikolai+Dahlia</a>'s newborn are adorable!</i><br /><b>"He was so fierce and powerful, but he treated her soul with such gentleness. Who could not fall for a male like that?"</b><br /><br /><b>"She was breaking apart. And being built back together. Flung into space and beyond. Set free in a way she had never expected. She was cared for. Safe. Claimed."</b><br />Tess &amp; Max changed eachother for the better, Brighter. Heated the cold, Lighted the dark. <i>But the threats against her might unravel it all.</i><br />His Fixing, Protective nature &amp; Overworking made a divide; He kept things to protect her, so did she then. <i>They almost–DID–break...But Realisations, Apologies &amp; Faith brought Max+Tess together stronger!</i><br /><b>“...You are my mooring. You are my compass and my road home, my foundation and my pinnacle, my beginning and my end, my heart and my soul.”</b><br /><br />Together the Whole Skolov family executes an Ingenious plan, Awesome Showdown! Entirely surprising, with Action &amp; Twists! I loved that Max &amp; Tess were together throughout😀. <i>Then finally the obsessed Villain's annihilated, An Ex-friend sacrifices, Freeing confessions happen &amp; new clues reveal!</i> I'm also relieved that the other Slaves are saved.<br /><br /><b>"Maxheim was done putting off all his happiness for a later rotation. Life was too short. His time with Tess too precious to waste."</b><br />Max &amp; Tess deserved their HEA, Their joy warms me💘. The ending &amp; Epilogue are lovely!<br />But With still much to uncover...And, ooh, Wtf did Alexi (3rd Skolov brother) just do?! I'm so excited for his book next!!<br />**<i>ARC Gotten for a Honest Review.</i>**<br /><a href="https://m.facebook.com/ToonasaLovesBooks/" rel="nofollow noopener">FB Page</a> | <a href="https://www.instagram.com/toonasa.loves.books/" rel="nofollow noopener">Instagram</a> | <a href="https://www.bookbub.com/profile/89245731" rel="nofollow noopener">Bookbub</a> | <a href="https://m.facebook.com/groups/164936121697459/" rel="nofollow noopener">FB group</a></span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/81913577?shelf=arc-beauty-2021" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">arc-beauty-2021</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/81913577?shelf=omegaverse_all-types" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">omegaverse_all-types</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/81913577?shelf=sci-fi-tech" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">sci-fi-tech</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">19 likes</span></button></div><div class="Button__container"><button type=