th></svg></span><span class="baseClass RatingStar--small"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" role="presentation"><path class="RatingStar__fill" d="M24 9.63469C24 9.35683 23.7747 9.13158 23.4969 9.13158H15.0892L12.477 1.34327C12.4269 1.19375 12.3095 1.0764 12.16 1.02625C11.8966 0.937894 11.6114 1.07983 11.523 1.34327L8.91088 9.13158H0.503157C0.33975 9.13158 0.186521 9.21094 0.0922364 9.3444C-0.0680877 9.57134 -0.0140806 9.88529 0.212865 10.0456L7.00408 14.8432L4.40172 22.6166C4.35092 22.7683 4.37534 22.9352 4.46749 23.066C4.6275 23.2932 4.94137 23.3476 5.16853 23.1876L12 18.3758L18.8317 23.183C18.9625 23.2751 19.1293 23.2994 19.281 23.2486C19.5445 23.1604 19.6865 22.8752 19.5983 22.6117L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3946331827">June 21, 2021</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">Outstanding!!! After reading book 1, I could not wait to get my hands on Maxheim Skolov!!! I needed him like I needed my next breath. <br /><br />Alison Aimes has WOWed me once again with her talented words, amazing storytelling, and her brilliant mind. After the first chapter I was hooked, pulled in, and I never wanted to leave. I wanted to stay in this dark mafia omegaverse world and leave reality behind. <br /><br />This story was everything I’d hoped for and everything I needed it to be. It was raw and gritty, full of lies and betrayal and suspense and all the sizzling sparks and delicious feels and fated mate goodness that makes my heart beat faster. <br /><br />Maxheim Skolov, one of the most powerful, badass crime lords, is on a mission. He’s a caretaker, the fixer, his goal is to find the twins and destroy anything and anyone who gets in his way. My gawd he is sexy AF when he’s angry and determined. <br /><br />Being a slave her whole life, Tess doesn’t know how to act when she’s rescued, treated with kindness and respect, and given choices. Especially when it’s Maxheim Skolov. He’s not the type to give away such gestures. <br /><br />Her whole world is turned upside down. Trust doesn’t come easy for her. She’s so confused, overwhelmed, and maybe a bit… hopeful. <br /><br />Watching Tess change from that first time Maxheim saw her in the cage, to all the times he protects hers every chance he gets, to the time he begs for her forgiveness…<br /><br />Oh. My. Goodness. <br />I could feel everything. <br />I felt his power. <br />I sensed his rage. <br />I experienced his pain. <br />His love was intense and his passion was scorching hot. I felt that, too. <br /><br />MY HEART. <br />It now belongs to Maxheim. <br /><br />He made me want to present, made me want to purr, and I wanted him to tell me what to do. I would happily do it. I would be his omega ANY. DAY. <br /><br />His patience with Tess made me swoon hard. <br />His kindness was heartwarming. <br />His protectiveness gave me warm fuzzies. <br /><br />Not only was Maxheim sexy AF and making me want to do…anything, but his brothers… My goodness those Skolov men are fierce and intense and powerful and so fucking HOT. I’ve got Alexi and Damian in my sights and can’t wait to devour their stories. <br /><br />I just knew Savage Prince was going to have my heart pounding from cover to cover. I knew the characters were going to steal my heart. I knew this author would deliver in all the delicious ways to make me happy and satisfied. <br /><br />Again I am blown away. <br />Again I had my socks rocked right off. And once again, I’m anxiously awaiting more. I need Alexi’s story yesterday. </span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"