ps://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3969021033">June 12, 2021</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">Wahoo! What a great way to spend the evening! In this world there are Alphas who lead, Betas who follow and Omegas who submit. Tess is an Omega and wants out of her nightmare of a situation, along with her friends. I was immediately taken with Tess, her strength and her desire to help others. She is being used for her “gift” to hurt others and even though she doesn’t want to, she doesn’t have a choice in the matter. In comes Maxheim, not your typical Alpha, but all Alpha in all the ways we want in this well written romance. He has been working hard to write a wrong from years past and Tess is not what he needs right now. It messes up all his plans. Yet, Maxheim is much happier with Tess. He does all he can to keep her. I really enjoyed the story line and how it progressed. A few pleasant surprises along the way that made the romance story line unique. I really enjoyed it and look forward to the next book in the series. Highly recommend. </span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">8 likes</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="