12.3095 1.0764 12.16 1.02625C11.8966 0.937894 11.6114 1.07983 11.523 1.34327L8.91088 9.13158H0.503157C0.33975 9.13158 0.186521 9.21094 0.0922364 9.3444C-0.0680877 9.57134 -0.0140806 9.88529 0.212865 10.0456L7.00408 14.8432L4.40172 22.6166C4.35092 22.7683 4.37534 22.9352 4.46749 23.066C4.6275 23.2932 4.94137 23.3476 5.16853 23.1876L12 18.3758L18.8317 23.183C18.9625 23.2751 19.1293 23.2994 19.281 23.2486C19.5445 23.1604 19.6865 22.8752 19.5983 22.6117L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3804345384">June 23, 2021</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">4.75 stars!<br /><br />This is the second book in the Ruthless Warlords series and I LOVED IT. This story features Tess and Maxheim. Maxheim and his brothers are on a mission to find their twin siblings that were taken from them when they were young. Maxheim is the fixer of the family and shoulders most of the burdens, guilt and stress that he thinks he has to carry. His reputation is that of a cold Alpha with a singular focus on revenge, dominance and destruction of his enemies. Until he runs into Tess at a slavers auction while looking for information. <br /><br />Maxheim who never saw himself taking a mate ends up realizing that Tess is his fated mate and he will do anything to bind her to him forever. She may also be the key to discovering more information about his lost siblings. But Tess has secrets and her own doubts about herself and her abilities. Tess' Omega gift is rare and deadly and her whole life she has been used as a pawn and a killer. Can Maxheim convince Tess that he is worth taking a chance on? Can Tess come to realize the power she carries can be used for good and embrace a bright and hopeful future with Maxheim? Will the Skolovs get closer to locating their siblings? What will happen with the changing political landscape?<br /><br />This story was filled with action, secrets, revenge, heat and revelations. I adored Maxheim...he was dominant, possessive, obsessive...just how I like my alpha males. His relationship not only with his family but Tess was just so swoony I almost couldn't handle it. Maxheim taught Tess that she is more than what people have labeled her to be and deserves everything and Tess taught Maxheim that he doesn't have to carry all the pain and guilt from the past. The only thing that bothered me about this story was how stubborn Tess was and how she always wanted to resort to being the sacrificial lamb. I wanted her to grow into her own just a little faster. <br /><br />Overall, if you like Omegaverse with a super alpha male that worships the ground his omega walks on, an omega that is not just a wallflower and a steamy and action-packed plot then definitely pick this up. I CANNOT wait for the next book in this series...it's gonna be good I can tell.</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">9 likes</span></button></div><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">5 comments</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to 