y indulged willingness to slash any bitch that poses threat to his female. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDid I like him? I had to copy past his name from the blurb, he imprinted himself on my memory that much. Maxheim can waste his charm on someone else. 🥰\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI literally have nothing to say about either \u003cb\u003eTess\u003c/b\u003e, besides the unlucky coincidence of her being an annoyingly indecisive when it came to giving her vote of credit wench with violet eyes OR the plot that is a jumbled mess (tautology says hi) of incomprehensible alphas, omegas and betas I didn't give a single flying fuck about doing things (chasing, killing, abducting, selling, rutting, saving... I'm exasperated, you see) I had no interest in reading about. 👏🏻🤡\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAs far as I'm concerned, the relationship dynamics in romance needs to be riveting to keep my interest in anything besides it alive. Straightforward, obvious and safe from scratch?? MY NERVE CELLS WANT TO DIE A SLOW, AGONISING DEATH BEFORE THEY RESURRECT IN THE FACE OF satisfying HAPPILY EVER AFTER at the end. I didn't scream that last sentence, by the way. 🥰\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://images.gr-assets.com/hostedimages/1630176755ra/31845923.gif\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e","rating":2,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AV979A5RENOKL\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4TA1hhKj-lvGUB6j\"}}"},"likeCount":120,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":30},"User:11626803":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":11626803,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1700448182i/11626803._UX200_CR0,29,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":36791,"textReviewsCount":2155,"name":"Val ⚓️ Shameless Handmaiden ⚓️","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/11626803-val-shameless-handmaiden","co