reator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/ABSF31D7FMC7V\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.i0mlg7-UHTGZwEh4\"}}"},"likeCount":105,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":9},"User:10717098":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":10717098,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1626057011i/10717098._UX200_CR0,33,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":25385,"textReviewsCount":3197,"name":"Carol [Goodreads Addict]","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/10717098-carol-goodreads-addict","contributor":null,"id":10717098},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1HX9RKZVGY6BW":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1HX9RKZVGY6BW"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1HX9RKZVGY6BW\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4TA1hhKj-lvGUB6j\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1HX9RKZVGY6BW","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1HX9RKZVGY6BW"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4TA1hhKj-lvGUB6j","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4TA1hhKj-lvGUB6j"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/10717098?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"paranormal-fantasy","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/10717098?shelf=paranormal-fantasy"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4017427501"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.slHNgANJf2UK9rUXhXGgyg":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.slHNgANJf2UK9rUXhXGgyg","creator":{"__ref":"User:10717098"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1755824055446,"createdAt":1623797349593,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1624122898378,"text":"\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1623797361i/31496274._SY540_.jpg\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSavage Prince is book two in the Ruthless Warlords series by Alison Aimes. I’ve been in love with this series since the first book. These books take place in a parallel Alphaverse galaxy. It’s dark and dangerous. But these Skolov siblings have stolen my heart. This is Maxheim’s book.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eMaxheim Skolov considers himself to be the “fixer” of the family. When there is a problem with any of his siblings, he solves it. His family’s safety is all that matters to him. And now, finding the long lost twins that were stolen from them when they were infants. Maxheim is cold, ruthless and completely driven. Now that his older brother is mated, he tries to take as much of the responsibility onto his own shoulders as he can. It’s on a mission, though, that everything changes. That he finds…her!!!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1623797361i/31496275.jpg\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eTess is an omega slave. She has a rare and deadly gift and is forced to use it against her will. Her life is dismal and not worth living except that the other female slave’s survival rests on her shoulders. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIn this world, every alpha has one fated mate, an omega made just for him. Some alphas avoid such a match because once you bond with your fated mate, everything else fades away. Your mate becomes the focus of your entire world, all that matters. Maxheim knows right away that he has found her and in that instant, his world is rearranged. She is his laser focus, her survival, her happiness, her pleasure. It’s all that matters. Only, for some reason, Tess doesn’t seem as willing to bond with him!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\n  \u003ci\u003e“I will always find a way to light your way and keep you from the dark.”\u003c/i\u003e\n\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eTess might be a tiny omega but she is strong and determined. She has never known anyone that wanted to care for her in the way Maxheim does. She struggles to trust that his motives are pure. Her survival instinct tells her to run. But her heart wants to believe that this could be real.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\n  \u003ci\u003e“You are my compass and my road home, my foundation and my pinnacle, my beginning and my end, my heart and my soul.”\u003c/i\u003e\n\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eTess and Maxheim are trying to adjust to being fated mates but at the same time, everything possible is threatening both them and Maxheim’s family. Of course, Maxheim wants to bear the entire burden on his own shoulders but Tess isn’t having it. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1623797361i/31496276._SY540_.jpg\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThis book, just as the previous book, keeps you on the edge of your seat from start to finish. I loved watching Maxheim evolve after finding Tess. He is so hard and cold but after he found Tess, he became absolutely swoony! These two together burned up the pages. I truly love this family and their commitment to each other, the way they interact. I never thought I would fall in love with a world like this one but I have and I can’t wait for the next book which will be Alexi’s book, Broken Heir. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFor more about this book and so many others, come and visit me at Carol's Crazy Bookish World.\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/CarolsCrazyBookishWorld\"\u003ehttps://www.facebook.com/groups/Carol...\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1502304251i/23548582.jpg\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1HX9RKZVGY6BW\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4TA1hhKj-lvGUB6j\"}}"},"likeCount":67,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":7},"User:81374210":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":81374210,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1741829273i/81374210._UX200_CR0,39,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":623,"textReviewsCount":808,"name":"Meredith is a hot mess","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/81374210-meredith-is-a-hot-mess","contributor":null,"id":81374210},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1N803JX1NEO91":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1N803JX1NEO91"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1N803JX1NEO91\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4TA1hhKj-lvGUB6j\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1N803JX1NEO91","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1N803JX1NEO91"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4TA1hhKj-lvGUB6j","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4TA1hhKj-lvGUB6j"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/81374210?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"omegaverse","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/81374210?shelf=omegaverse"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"mafia","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/81374210?shelf=mafia"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"escorts-strippers-sex-workers","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/81374210?shelf=escorts-strippers-sex-workers"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3685767604"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.-C2stBrLaKQA0QhGQ5ZhvQ":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.-C2stBrLaKQA0QhGQ5ZhvQ","creator":{"__ref":"User:81374210"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1752087290761,"createdAt":1624470185372,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1648779854939,"text":"\u003cb\u003eEdit\u003c/b\u003e: I'm editing my initial 4 star review to 3 stars. I need to be honest with myself. This book simply did not captivate me as much as Ruthless King and was again too long. There were periods that I had to push myself to finish it. Anytime I feel the urge to skim I can't justify a 4 star rating. A valid criticism is that the author writes books that are too long. I totally get other readers becoming bored in this series. The writing isn't tight and the author over explains scenes. That said, this is a fully-fleshed out world and the author is talented. The world she has created here is vibrant. I do like this Omegaverse and will read the rest of the series. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e*****\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\n  \u003ci\u003eShe was in grave trouble. Because this male was not just some new arrival, he was Maxheim Skolov: second-in-command of one of the most powerful crime families in the galaxy. The exacting mastermind behind the empire. And he was here to kill her for what she’d done to his fellow Brotherhood members. The darkness inside her returned with a vengeance.\u003c/i\u003e\n\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003eSavage Prince\u003c/i\u003e was fast-paced, action-packed, intense, and smokin' hot :-) The key qualities that describe Alison Aimes' writing style are all present here: electric, energetic, \u0026amp; compelling. While this book has dark elements (\u003cinput type=\"checkbox\" class=\"spoiler__control\" aria-label=\"The following text has been marked spoiler. Toggle checkbox to reveal or hide.\" onchange=\"this.labels[0].setAttribute('aria-hidden', !this.checked);\" id=\"6481cb1a-7bbf-4ab1-a5ea-3f84be856355\" /\u003e\u003clabel aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"spoiler\" for=\"6481cb1a-7bbf-4ab1-a5ea-3f84be856355\"\u003e: graphic murder, violence, sex trafficking, \u0026amp; abuse (but not from the hero)\u003c/label\u003e, the overall story has heart. The H is an alphahole, but one who caves to his Omega. Omegaverse readers who like dominating/possessive Alphas will love Maxheim. I found him very likable. I \u003ci\u003eloved\u003c/i\u003e Tess. I like that she came from an underprivileged background. I felt the author delved into her psychology, and really thought about how someone like Tess would have learned to survive \u0026amp; cope in her circumstances. She has a cynical exterior, but vulnerable core. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI was delighted to see a Dread Pirate Roberts twist in the plot regarding the villain! \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://images.gr-assets.com/hostedimages/1624577641ra/31543749.gif\" width=\"640\" height=\"330\" alt=\"description\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://images.gr-assets.com/hostedimages/1624577710ra/31543751.gif\" width=\"585\" height=\"285\" alt=\"description\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThose who have watched \u003ci\u003eThe Princess Bride\u003c/i\u003e \u0026amp; have read this book will hopefully get my meaning. I'm not elaborating to prevent spoiling :) \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eBtw the word \u003ci\u003e\n  \u003cb\u003eMine\u003c/b\u003e\n\u003c/i\u003e in this book is basically the equivalent of this:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://images.gr-assets.com/hostedimages/1624577839ra/31543754.gif\" width=\"560\" height=\"360\" alt=\"description\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eMaxheim totally goes caveman around Tess, but in reality he's putty in her hands and will go to great lengths to have her. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eOverall I recommend this book to Omegaverse readers, especially those who like scifi or mafia - and especially those who like this kind of Alpha/omega trope. The author is nailing it in this series. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eTrigger Warnings\u003c/b\u003e: \u003cinput type=\"checkbox\" class=\"spoiler__control\" aria-label=\"The following text has been marked spoiler. Toggle checkbox to reveal or hide.\" onchange=\"this.labels[0].setAttribute('aria-hidden', !this.checked);\" id=\"7793f1fb-8f2e-4494-8111-f9e1308e8329\" /\u003e\u003clabel aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"spoiler\" for=\"7793f1fb-8f2e-4494-8111-f9e1308e8329\"\u003eGraphic murder, graphic violence, abuse (not from the H)\u003c/label\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eSafety\u003c/b\u003e: \u003cinput type=\"checkbox\" class=\"spoiler__control\" aria-label=\"The following text has been marked spoiler. Toggle checkbox to reveal or hide.\" onchange=\"this.labels[0].setAttribute('aria-hidden', !this.checked);\" id=\"9a762bb4-cb5e-4545-b152-eb7bbefc37af\" /\u003e\u003clabel aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"spoiler\" for=\"9a762bb4-cb5e-4545-b152-eb7bbefc37af\"\u003eNo cheating, no ow drama. The H is possessive \u0026amp; centered on the Omega. Not even a mention of past relationships/hook ups.\u003c/label\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eHEA\u003c/b\u003e: Yes. This book is a standalone \u0026amp; ends with a HEA. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e*Note: While this book can be read first in the series (this is a standalone series) you'll get more context and backstory regarding the twins, the Skolov brothers, and the Brotherhood if you've at least read book 1, Ruthless King. With that said, if you start with this book you'll understand the main romance between the couple just fine - they both meet for the first time in this book. Just other elements to the plot that I mentioned above first start to develop in book 1.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e*ARC kindly provided by the author\u003c/[\"br\"]\u003e\u003c/[\"br\"]\u003e\u003c/[\"br\"]\u003e\u003c/[\"br\"]\u003e\u003c/[\"br\"]\u003e\u003c/[\"br\"]\u003e\u003c/[\"br\"]\u003e\u003c/[\"br\"]\u003e\u003c/[\"br\"]\u003e\u003c/[\"br\"]\u003e\u003c/[\"br\"]\u003e\u003c/[\"br\"]\u003e\u003c/[\"br\"]\u003e\u003c/[\"br\"]\u003e\u003c/[\"br\"]\u003e\u003c/[\"br\"]\u003e\u003c/[\"br\"]\u003e\u003c/[\"br\"]\u003e\u003c/[\"br\"]\u003e\u003c/[\"br\"]\u003e\u003c/[\"br\"]\u003e\u003c/[\"br\"]\u003e\u003c/[\"br\"]\u003e\u003c/[\"br\"]\u003e\u003c/[\"br\"]\u003e\u003c/[\"br\"]\u003e\u003c/[\"br\"]\u003e\u003c/[\"br\"]\u003e\u003c/[\"br\"]\u003e\u003c/[\"br\"]\u003e\u003c/[\"br\"]\u003e","rating":3,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1N803JX1NEO91\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4TA1hhKj-lvGUB6j\"}}"},"likeCount":30,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":6},"User:70316517":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":70316517,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1570843185i/70316517.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":2764,"textReviewsCount":3284,"name":"Ꮗ€♫◗☿ ❤️ ilikebooksbest.com ❤️","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/70316517-ilikebooksbest-com","contributor":null,"id":70316517},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3J3RKFOMWF33B":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3J3RKFOMWF33B"},"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.AspRbxYd1ZI_uXKI":{"__typename":"Book","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.AspRbxYd1ZI_uXKI"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3J3RKFOMWF33B\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.AspRbxYd1ZI_uXKI\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3J3RKFOMWF33B","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3J3RKFOMWF33B"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.AspRbxYd1ZI_uXKI","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.AspRbxYd1ZI_uXKI"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/70316517?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"00-audiobooks-i-own","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/70316517?shelf=00-audiobooks-i-own"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"action-adventure","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/70316517?shelf=action-adventure"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"audiobook","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/70316517?shelf=audiobook"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"dark-romance","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/70316517?shelf=dark-romance"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"mafia","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/70316517?shelf=mafia"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"paranormal","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/70316517?shelf=paranormal"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"romance","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/70316517?shelf=romance"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"aliens","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/70316517?shelf=aliens"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"science-fiction","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/70316517?shelf=science-fiction"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/6436337575"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.yDn5SqtaPybEHBOt3eWW6w":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.yDn5SqtaPybEHBOt3eWW6w","creator":{"__ref":"User:70316517"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1716130727636,"createdAt":1713621705233,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1713889038522,"text":"\u003cb\u003eGood alien romance omegaverse story with duet narration!\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1713621712i/35434685._SY540_.png\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eThe following ratings are out of 5:\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eRomance: 💙❤️💚💜\u003cbr\u003eSteam: 🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥\u003cbr\u003eStory/Plot: 📕📗📘📙\u003cbr\u003eWorld building: 🌏🌍🌏🌍\u003cbr\u003eCharacter development: 😊😅🤨🥰\u003cbr\u003eNarration: 🎙🎙🎙🎙🎙\u003cbr\u003eNarration Type: Duet Narration\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eThe Hero:\u003c/b\u003e \u003cu\u003eMaxheim Skolov\u003c/u\u003e - he was born an alpha male in the Anarcheim Alphaverse. Maxheim is brother to Nikolai Skolov, the head alpha boss of the Skolov clan in the Brotherhood syndicate. At the end of the last book, they all found out that their twin siblings whom they thought were killed in a fire when they were babies, were instead stolen and are probably still alive. They also found that some unknown alpha was behind a failed coup attempt on the Brotherhood. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eThe heroine:\u003c/b\u003e \u003cu\u003eTess \u003c/u\u003e - she was born an omega and grew up as a slave. She and her best friend Rav lived on the streets, the forgotten. They were born of alpha males without a house name. After they were caught, Tess was drugged in an attempt to bring out her gift to demand a higher price. Her friend Rav later turned out to be the same silver skinned man who took the Skolov twins years ago. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eThe Story:\u003c/b\u003e Maxheim was always the dependable right-hand man to his older brother Nikolai, he was the fixer of the family. Though recently he has been a bit scattered. He had been trying to track down the silver skinned man who took their twin siblings over fifteen years ago and who was working for the man behind the coup attempt on the Brotherhood. When Dahlia had a vision of Tess and Rav as children, Maxheim immediately showed signs of being fated mates with Tess. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI liked Maxheim, he was complicated and brutal. He had a former relationship with an omega who was killed and though he wasn’t in love with her, he felt guilty for her death since it was by a gang that did it to get back at the Skolov family. Also, he just committed to a deal with a rival family from the Brotherhood in which he would make one of their daughters his prime omega. He didn’t want to find Tess, though he did find her at a rowdy slave auction. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eTess was a slave, sold at auction over and over by her owner, for short amounts of time. She still had her gift, and it was a doozy. For every bit of pain an alpha caused her, the alpha got unimaginable bliss, but the bliss was short lived, and they ended up paying the price with their lives. She wanted nothing more than to save the young omegas and Rav who were also owned by Aldar, the same man that owns her. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe story was really good, and I liked both characters. I saw quite a few reviews where the reviewers didn’t really like Tess, but I thought she was interesting and genuine. Like the first book, this one was super steamy, though after listening to the two audiobooks in a row, it was a bit too much for me. I ended up fast forwarding through many of the intimate scenes. I wanted more story and less smut. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThis audiobook was told in dual points of view via duet narration and was narrated by Jason Clarke and Stella Hunter. They are two of my favorite narrators. Jason has a deep gravelly voice which is perfect for a mafia boss, and he is fantastic at dirty talk, which I love. Stella has a soft but clear voice which is very pleasant, and she she is great at showing emotion through her voice.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.ilikebooksbest.com\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eBlog\u003c/a\u003e|\u003ca href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/wennel\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eGoodreads\u003c/a\u003e|\u003ca href=\"https://www.facebook.com/ilikebooksbest\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eFacebook\u003c/a\u003e|\u003ca href=\"https://www.instagram.com/ilikebooksbest\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eInstagram\u003c/a\u003e|\u003ca href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/ilikebooksbest/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003ePinterest\u003c/a\u003e|\u003ca href=\"https://www.bookbub.com/profile/1895823057\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eBookBub\u003c/a\u003e","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3J3RKFOMWF33B\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.AspRbxYd1ZI_uXKI\"}}"},"likeCount":21,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:145247010":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":145247010,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1685036903i/145247010._UY200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":570,"textReviewsCount":265,"name":"readabookonce","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/145247010-readabookonce","contributor":null,"id":145247010},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1B1XSF89XO4EM":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1B1XSF89XO4EM"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1B1XSF89XO4EM\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.i0mlg7-UHTGZwEh4\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1B1XSF89XO4EM","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1B1XSF89XO4EM"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.i0mlg7-UHTGZwEh4","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.i0mlg7-UHTGZwEh4"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/145247010?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"alien","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/145247010?shelf=alien"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"captivity","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/145247010?shelf=captivity"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"fated-mates","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/145247010?shelf=fated-mates"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"grovel","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/145247010?shelf=grovel"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5715811617"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.w3K4J1Sv6uhEZp_8DB-i0g":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.w3K4J1Sv6uhEZp_8DB-i0g","creator":{"__ref":"User:145247010"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1690745111319,"createdAt":1690250718100,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1690250785228,"text":"That grovel scene really did something for me, and I will accept no less from future books I read.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eMAIN CHARACTER NAMES AND AGES\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eTesstala “Tess” “Tessie” (~24) \u003cb\u003e|\u003c/b\u003e Maxheim Skolov (26)\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eFEATURES\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e∘ sci-if mafia romance\u003cbr /\u003e∘ omegaverse\u003cbr /\u003e∘ fated mates\u003cbr /\u003e∘ he saves her from captivity \u003cbr /\u003e∘ him on his knees begging for forgiveness\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eREVIEW\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI love a matebond, especially when the MMC is so quick to accept it. He was ready to die to protect her from day one, and I was giggling about it. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe plot from \u003ca href=\"https://goodreads.com/book/show/55919400.Ruthless_King__Ruthless_Warlords__1_\" title=\"Ruthless King (Ruthless Warlords #1) by Alison Aimes\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003eRuthless King\u003c/a\u003e is extended into this one, but it’s not until the end that it advances. While a lot happened in the novel action-wise, the overarching plot moved at a snail’s pace. Since so much of the angst hinged on this, it made the story feel dragged out and repetitive. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe building of the story and development of the relationship was nicely done and made for a compelling read. I will be starting the next book here shortly and then the next and then—\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eOW/OM DRAMA\u003c/b\u003e minor \u003ci\u003eOM\u003c/i\u003e — Maxheim is jealous of an alpha who is friends with Tess; while the OM has feelings, she never has\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eCHEATING\u003c/b\u003e none\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eTHIRD ACT BREAKUP\u003c/b\u003e not really but there is tension that is promptly communicated through\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eENDING\u003c/b\u003e HEA — epilogue in different POV but is set shortly in the future\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003ePOV\u003c/b\u003e dual / third person\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eSPICE LEVEL\u003c/b\u003e 4.5 / 5\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eRATING\u003c/b\u003e 4 / 5","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1B1XSF89XO4EM\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.i0mlg7-UHTGZwEh4\"}}"},"likeCount":19,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":5},"User:93580497":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":93580497,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1595799963i/93580497._UX200_CR0,24,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":359,"textReviewsCount":836,"name":"Niki {Still a Widow but reading more}","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/93580497-niki-still-a-widow-but-reading-more","contributor":null,"id":93580497},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A25ZR619C803K7":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A25ZR619C803K7"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A25ZR619C803K7\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4TA1hhKj-lvGUB6j\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A25ZR619C803K7","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A25ZR619C803K7"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4TA1hhKj-lvGUB6j","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4TA1hhKj-lvGUB6j"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/93580497?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"books-i-read-in-2021","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/93580497?shelf=books-i-read-in-2021"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"arc","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/93580497?shelf=arc"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"very-alien-aliens","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/93580497?shelf=very-alien-aliens"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"phenomenal-hero","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/93580497?shelf=phenomenal-hero"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"omegaverse","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/93580497?shelf=omegaverse"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"mafia","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/93580497?shelf=mafia"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"fated-mates","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/93580497?shelf=fated-mates"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"amazing-sfr","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/93580497?shelf=amazing-sfr"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3768668091"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.6DItTzmx8LxG9H5K6IOcww":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.6DItTzmx8LxG9H5K6IOcww","creator":{"__ref":"User:93580497"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1686885419911,"createdAt":1624573299355,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1624907571824,"text":"What a ride!!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://images.gr-assets.com/hostedimages/1624566936ra/31542960.gif\" alt=\"Coaster GIFs - Get the best GIF on GIPHY\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIsn't lovely when a control freak loses control?\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://images.gr-assets.com/hostedimages/1624566936ra/31542961.gif\" alt=\"Losing My Mind Gif\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eOh sweet, uptight control freak Maxheim. I feel your pain, I too am the control freak of my family. Knowing the only reason everything isn't going to hell, is cause we're pulling all the strings tight keeping everything going and moving about how it should....Until we hit that unforeseen snag. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://images.gr-assets.com/hostedimages/1624566936ra/31542962.gif\" alt=\"The Gif Wars. No Words. Just Gifs. Let's talk with images. - Page 438\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eNothing like finding your fated mate AND she's part of the syndicate killing brotherhood members you've been after. Like the MAIN killer and like super besties with the silver douche bag you've been searching for that kidnapped your twin brother and sister 15 years ago!! Yeah...\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://images.gr-assets.com/hostedimages/1624566936ra/31542963.gif\" alt=\"request ` Teen Wolf peter hale stevensrogers i love sassy!peter more than i love most things (i apologize about them all being so d a r k i tried my best\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePoor sweet Tesstala, 'Tess', was being exploited. Her sweet and compassionate heart was being being twisted and used against her. Her love and trusting nature was misplaced on the worst backstabbers surrounding her. Using her in ways she could never have comprehended. Until she's 'rescued' by her fated mate Maxheim, and he shows her a whole new way of living. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI loved how Maxheim gave himself over to his relationship with Tess and everything it would entail, entirely. 100%. He didn't care what might happen, he would make a way. He was so protective of Tess and wanting her to know what it is like to be pampered, treated as an equal, and treated with love.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cblockquote\u003e\n  \u003cb\u003e\n    \u003ci\u003e“Tess.” his grip tightened. “Love doesn’t even begin to cover what I feel for you. It’s relentless. Savage. Primitive. It’s breath and blood and life.”\u003cbr\u003eHer heart trembled in her chest.\u003cbr\u003eHis grip tightened, scowl deepening. “So, don’t fucking ask me to give you up. I won’t.”\u003c/i\u003e\n  \u003c/b\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://images.gr-assets.com/hostedimages/1391571017ra/8412698.gif\" alt=\"Jess-i-ca ~Sometimes a Gif Witch~ (Bossier City, LA)'s review of Ignite Me\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eTess, who's never had any notion of having what Maxheim is offering, is scared to let go and dive in because she's just waiting for the other shoe to drop and everything to be ripped away. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cblockquote\u003e\n  \u003cb\u003e\n    \u003ci\u003eI never thought I’d be one of the lucky ones. But that’s what it feels like.” She clutched her treasure closer. “That’s what it feels like to be yours\"\u003c/i\u003e\n  \u003c/b\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eNot to mention the 3 separate entities that are trying to steal her away and kill Maxheim and all the Skolovs. She knows that in life we rarely get what we want and love isn't always enough. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://images.gr-assets.com/hostedimages/1624569983ra/31543049.gif\" alt=\"Shower Couple GIF - Shower Couple Hug - Discover \u0026amp; Share GIFs\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe ups and downs in this one, the tension, had my emotions all over the place. I loved Maxheim and Tess. I loved how they each were what the other needed to break free from their shackles and live. How they gave each other the ability to let go and love, and have something for themselves. Maxheim and Tess fought and built trust, doing what it took to create that strong foundation for an unshakable future. And I must say, I love how I was pleasantly surprised by Maxheim. How he had forced Tess into a corner, and I thought oh I know how this is gonna go, he's forcing her hand she gonna go do what we all don't want her to do....but instead Maxheim, like a responsible adult man, went and got down on his knees and begged for Tess's forgiveness. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://images.gr-assets.com/hostedimages/1595643805ra/29860774.gif\" alt=\"forgive me gifs | WiffleGif\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThis was so good! It was emotional, suspenseful, and steamy as all get out. I can't recommend this series enough!!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eEven though this is an ARC review, I will always shoot you straight. I received an ARC in exchange for an honest review.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A25ZR619C803K7\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4TA1hhKj-lvGUB6j\"}}"},"likeCount":20,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":7},"User:39243185":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":39243185,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1714028563i/39243185._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":1422,"textReviewsCount":2713,"name":"Natalie  ~ The Biblioholic","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/39243185-natalie-the-biblioholic","contributor":null,"id":39243185},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AOBOV56WXMZO7":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AOBOV56WXMZO7"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AOBOV56WXMZO7\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.i0mlg7-UHTGZwEh4\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AOBOV56WXMZO7","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AOBOV56WXMZO7"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.i0mlg7-UHTGZwEh4","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.i0mlg7-UHTGZwEh4"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/39243185?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"aliens","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/39243185?shelf=aliens"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"dual-pov","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/39243185?shelf=dual-pov"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"fated-mates","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/39243185?shelf=fated-mates"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"sci-fi","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/39243185?shelf=sci-fi"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4617930472"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.2bKLtvdasEEd1ObcX8Nmuw":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.2bKLtvdasEEd1ObcX8Nmuw","creator":{"__ref":"User:39243185"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1686885430455,"createdAt":1647723739743,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1647774741235,"text":"I didn't like Tess, but I sure did like this story.\u003cbr\u003eI couldn't get enough of Maxheim.\u003cbr\u003eI enjoyed some more of the world building and what all of the characters added to the big story (even the bad guys).\u003cbr\u003eI loved how dedicated Max was to his omega. Who can resist an Alpha who can be weak and vulnerable for his mate? I know I can't.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI do wish that Tess wasn't so hard to like. She fought, which I liked. I do love strong females, but she fought too hard against Max, who had already shown how much he cared and was willing to do to make her happy. What more could he really do to illustrate how great of a male he was? Why did she feel the need to keep lying, hiding, fighting, etc.? It got repetitive, hurtful, and boring, which was unexpected because this author has amazed me with everything I've read.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eNot to say I wasn't still amazed. I obviously was. But this wasn't my favorite story of the series.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI really want to see what happens next. Is the Sartin female Alexi's fated mate? Will they find their twin siblings? And who is this secret saboteur who has been pulling the strings and wreaking havoc on the Brotherhood, especially my beloved Skolovs?\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eFind more \u003ca href=\"https://www.nbiblioholic.com/2022/03/review-savage-prince-by-alison-aimes.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eon the blog\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1647774741i/32708376._SX540_.jpg\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://p