eads.v1.ApCT1jDZ_O84ZA6T_n2oXw":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.ApCT1jDZ_O84ZA6T_n2oXw","creator":{"__ref":"User:81913577"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1625583051881,"createdAt":1623776161235,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1624030499577,"text":"\u003cb\u003e\"I Choose You.\"\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eA Savage yet beautiful Addition to this epic series!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eAn Unputdownable Sci-fi romance with Heart-pounding Action \u0026amp; Danger, Sinfully Hot lust, Heartaching Hurts, Betrayal, Trust, Truths, Hope \u0026amp; Healing, Vulnerable Emotions, Twists, Smarts, Drama \u0026amp; Fun, Beautiful Swoons, Heartfelt Love, An Ingenious Showdown, A cherished HEA \u0026amp; I'm Pumped up for More!\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis book gripped me, made me feel it all. I love Maxheim \u0026amp; Tess so much, Their Bravery strengthens me. I DEVOURED this in 8hrs, Alison you did it again!💘\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003ci\u003eThis story takes place in Anarcheim, a parallel Alphaverse galaxy, With Varied Alien life. Alphas lead, betas serve, and omegas submit. Where violence is a way of life, power is essential to survival, and crime is king.\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e(Loving the World building \u0026amp; Character Development!)\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e\"They were two souls from very different worlds, twisted and remade by life’s challenges, who fit together perfectly.\"\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eMaxheim \u0026amp; Tesstala both lived harsh lives. Max \u0026amp; his Siblings only had eachother after a tragedy, grew from nothing to Mafia \"Royalty\". Tess is an orphan, captured. For years, her \"Owner\" abused her deadly omega power, \u0026amp; She let's him, to keep her friends safe \u0026amp; alive.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e\"She might not know it yet, but she needed him. Just as he needed her.\"\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e\"He was calculating and savage and unquestionably ruthless, but never cruel.\"\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eMaxheim Skolov (2nd eldest brother, Alpha) is the fixer (\u0026amp; Inventor) of their family \u0026amp; Empire. The Investigation/Search for enemy \u0026amp; their long-lost twin Siblings' going on. This takes them to an illegal Auction, Where Tess is too. \u003ci\u003eCue an uproar, Killer instinct, Undeniable Bond...Plans fractured \u0026amp; remade, Their world forever realigned \u0026amp; refocuses...On eachother.\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e\"Beautiful chaos. That’s what she was.\"\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e“...From you, I want what’s given, not seized. Earned, not stolen.”\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eMax+Tess are blazing fire, Sinful lust, Inevitable, Fated. But also...Enemies (Cue fun Banters!). \u003ci\u003eAfter all, She's friends to Rav, the one they're after, her Fellow slave.\u003c/i\u003e But then they're targeted (F'ing Feds!), Dearest Betrayals \u0026amp; Truths Found...Dangers bring them closer.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e\"...this male, who should have been her enemy, kept being her ally and her anchor.\"\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e\"He understood her needs and didn’t judge. His command truly was her pleasure, their interests aligned.\"\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis story has NO dull moment, So Fast-paced! Their trust builds through adventures (Ooh, Death Squad!). She's cautious, but he's in for the long haul. \u003ci\u003eHe Romances her, Breaks her walls; She Cares for him, Gentle \u0026amp; Kickass!\u003c/i\u003e Feelings grow, Attacks Escalate, Tension for future, Will they ever get to just BE?\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e“What’s between us, baby. It’s the kind of light that will never dim.”\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e\"She was his. And he was hers.\"\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWhen the two finally get to Max's home planet, I adore how she's accepted by his family easily! I love that M+T get some down time, to let their Fated mate bond bind tighter (Doc gives fun insights!). Their Happiness, Fun \u0026amp; Love Confessions so sweet❤.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003ci\u003eI'm glad that the Skolov bros open up to eachother😍, Plus the scenes with \u003ca href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3741791597\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eNikolai+Dahlia\u003c/a\u003e's newborn are adorable!\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e\"He was so fierce and powerful, but he treated her soul with such gentleness. Who could not fall for a male like that?\"\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e\"She was breaking apart. And being built back together. Flung into space and beyond. Set free in a way she had never expected. She was cared for. Safe. Claimed.\"\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eTess \u0026amp; Max changed eachother for the better, Brighter. Heated the cold, Lighted the dark. \u003ci\u003eBut the threats against her might unravel it all.\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eHis Fixing, Protective nature \u0026amp; Overworking made a divide; He kept things to protect her, so did she then. \u003ci\u003eThey almost–DID–break...But Realisations, Apologies \u0026amp; Faith brought Max+Tess together stronger!\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e“...You are my mooring. You are my compass and my road home, my foundation and my pinnacle, my beginning and my end, my heart and my soul.”\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eTogether the Whole Skolov family executes an Ingenious plan, Awesome Showdown! Entirely surprising, with Action \u0026amp; Twists! I loved that Max \u0026amp; Tess were together throughout😀. \u003ci\u003eThen finally the obsessed Villain's annihilated, An Ex-friend sacrifices, Freeing confessions happen \u0026amp; new clues reveal!\u003c/i\u003e I'm also relieved that the other Slaves are saved.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e\"Maxheim was done putting off all his happiness for a later rotation. Life was too short. His time with Tess too precious to waste.\"\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eMax \u0026amp; Tess deserved their HEA, Their joy warms me💘. The ending \u0026amp; Epilogue are lovely!\u003cbr /\u003eBut With still much to uncover...And, ooh, Wtf did Alexi (3rd Skolov brother) just do?! I'm so excited for his book next!!\u003cbr /\u003e**\u003ci\u003eARC Gotten for a Honest Review.\u003c/i\u003e**\u003cbr /\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://m.facebook.com/ToonasaLovesBooks/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eFB Page\u003c/a\u003e | \u003ca href=\"https://www.instagram.com/toonasa.loves.books/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eInstagram\u003c/a\u003e | \u003ca href=\"https://www.bookbub.com/profile/89245731\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eBookbub\u003c/a\u003e | \u003ca href=\"https://m.facebook.com/groups/164936121697459/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eFB group\u003c/a\u003e","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3JLDEK2WKLYKW\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4TA1hhKj-lvGUB6j\"}}"},"likeCount":19,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":2},"User:10821438":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":10821438,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1619878776i/10821438._UY200_CR33,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":72,"textReviewsCount":1418,"name":"Lori R.","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/10821438-lori-r","contributor":null,"id":10821438},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2WL9FG47U62TN":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2WL9FG47U62TN"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2WL9FG47U62TN\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4TA1hhKj-lvGUB6j\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2WL9FG47U62TN","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2WL9FG47U62TN"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4TA1hhKj-lvGUB6j","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4TA1hhKj-lvGUB6j"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/10821438?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3946331827"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.5_4zudA4J5C0mDp_qoeT8A":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.5_4zudA4J5C0mDp_qoeT8A","creator":{"__ref":"User:10821438"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1624534225291,"createdAt":1623958491050,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1624282873661,"text":"Outstanding!!! After reading book 1, I could not wait to get my hands on Maxheim Skolov!!! I needed him like I needed my next breath. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAlison Aimes has WOWed me once again with her talented words, amazing storytelling, and her brilliant mind. After the first chapter I was hooked, pulled in, and I never wanted to leave. I wanted to stay in this dark mafia omegaverse world and leave reality behind. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis story was everything I’d hoped for and everything I needed it to be. It was raw and gritty, full of lies and betrayal and suspense and all the sizzling sparks and delicious feels and fated mate goodness that makes my heart beat faster. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eMaxheim Skolov, one of the most powerful, badass crime lords, is on a mission. He’s a caretaker, the fixer, his goal is to find the twins and destroy anything and anyone who gets in his way. My gawd he is sexy AF when he’s angry and determined. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eBeing a slave her whole life, Tess doesn’t know how to act when she’s rescued, treated with kindness and respect, and given choices. Especially when it’s Maxheim Skolov. He’s not the type to give away such gestures. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eHer whole world is turned upside down. Trust doesn’t come easy for her. She’s so confused, overwhelmed, and maybe a bit… hopeful. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWatching Tess change from that first time Maxheim saw her in the cage, to all the times he protects hers every chance he gets, to the time he begs for her forgiveness…\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eOh. My. Goodness. \u003cbr /\u003eI could feel everything. \u003cbr /\u003eI felt his power. \u003cbr /\u003eI sensed his rage. \u003cbr /\u003eI experienced his pain. \u003cbr /\u003eHis love was intense and his passion was scorching hot. I felt that, too. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eMY HEART. \u003cbr /\u003eIt now belongs to Maxheim. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eHe made me want to present, made me want to purr, and I wanted him to tell me what to do. I would happily do it. I would be his omega ANY. DAY. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eHis patience with Tess made me swoon hard. \u003cbr /\u003eHis kindness was heartwarming. \u003cbr /\u003eHis protectiveness gave me warm fuzzies. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eNot only was Maxheim sexy AF and making me want to do…anything, but his brothers… My goodness those Skolov men are fierce and intense and powerful and so fucking HOT. I’ve got Alexi and Damian in my sights and can’t wait to devour their stories. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI just knew Savage Prince was going to have my heart pounding from cover to cover. I knew the characters were going to steal my heart. I knew this author would deliver in all the delicious ways to make me happy and satisfied. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAgain I am blown away. \u003cbr /\u003eAgain I had my socks rocked right off. And once again, I’m anxiously awaiting more. I need Alexi’s story yesterday. ","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2WL9FG47U62TN\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4TA1hhKj-lvGUB6j\"}}"}