e“You can shut me out. Attempt to retreat. It won’t work. I’ll drag you to the point of pleasure, to the edge of need, as many times as it takes for that stubborn, scared mind of yours to understand. You belong here. With me”\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e“You taste like every good dream I’ve ever had.”\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe storyline is fantastic and reads really well! While this is a standalone it’s best read in order of the series since it has a substantial side plot. Think…family tragedy, blackmail, murder, and secrets 🤫\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eomegaverse\u003cbr /\u003eman obsessed!!!! \u003cbr /\u003epossessive \u0026amp; obsessive mmc\u003cbr /\u003evirgin fmc\u003cbr /\u003eknotting 🪢 \u003cbr /\u003edub/non con encounters \u003cbr /\u003efated mates\u003cbr /\u003efound family \u003cbr /\u003eHEA","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A25GSKFZH1V81U\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4TA1hhKj-lvGUB6j\"}}"},"likeCount":10,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:6499789":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":6499789,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1781726611i/6499789._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":0,"textReviewsCount":2274,"name":"Set","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/6499789-set","contributor":null,"id":6499789},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1V040B8883EZD":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1V040B8883EZD"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1V040B8883EZD\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4TA1hhKj-lvGUB6j\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1V040B8883EZD","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1V040B8883EZD"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4TA1hhKj-lvGUB6j","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4TA1