"name":"book-reviews","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/9460945?shelf=book-reviews"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"fantasy","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/9460945?shelf=fantasy"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"fated-mates","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/9460945?shelf=fated-mates"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"spicy","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/9460945?shelf=spicy"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"omegaverse","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/9460945?shelf=omegaverse"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"romance","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/9460945?shelf=romance"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"sci-fi","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/9460945?shelf=sci-fi"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4078412995"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.FnaLrJDqpw2I3zy360nmtw":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.FnaLrJDqpw2I3zy360nmtw","creator":{"__ref":"User:9460945"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1686885429152,"createdAt":1624837746238,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1638367553333,"text":"\u003cimg src=\"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1598989163i/30047654.jpg\" alt=\"Untitled design-High-Quality\" width=\"686\" height=\"88\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1598991425i/30047740.gif\" alt=\"My Review\" width=\"468\" height=\"60\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI enjoyed this a lot it’s a Sci-fi fantasy omegaverse and part of a series this one is about the brother from the previous book Maxheim he’s the fixer of the family always in control of his emotions that is until he runs into his fated-mate in the most unexpected of places and she manages to turn his ordered world upside down.\u003cbr\u003eTess is an omega slave with a very powerful gift one she can use as a weapon when Maxheim appears at the latest omega auction on the trail of his sibling's kidnapper he instantly recognises her as his own and sets about claiming her.\u003cbr\u003eDiscovering then that their lives are more intertwined than they could realise and that there are others who also want Tess Maxheim definitely has his work cut out keeping her hidden and safe.\u003cbr\u003eThere’s a death squad on their tail and the brotherhood also wants Tess handed over for her part in their men’s deaths.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eMaxheim surprised me the way he wanted Tess to choose him and not just take but also give and though his dominant protective nature sometimes got in the way of his sense he really did try to give Tess choices whenever possible winning her over with his care and obvious regard.\u003cbr\u003eTess was initially suspicious of course her background doesn’t breed trust easily and with further revelations coming forth about those she trusted blindly she does naturally start to question her own judgement.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThis was intense and super hot these two had so much chemistry together it projected off the page.\u003cbr\u003eTess was actually quite reasonable she wasn’t a drama Queen which I liked she wasn’t one of those heroines that like to act stupidly and make rash decisions and I liked how she realised how lucky she was in Maxheim as a mate. her one flaw was not realising her own worth and thinking that her only value was that of a bargaining chip placing herself as less important. Maxheim well he was just so lickable and totally delicious.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThis was a great addition to the series and I enjoyed it a lot, it was action-packed throughout and the heat levels were through the roof I definitely recommend this it’s very imaginative with some great world-building.\u003cbr\u003eI voluntary reviewed a copy of Savage Prince (Ruthless Warlords #2).\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1598991966i/30047768.gif\" alt=\"Untitled design\" width=\"686\" height=\"88\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eReviewed By Beckie Bookworm\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/beckiebookworm/\"\u003ehttps://www.facebook.com/beckiebookworm/\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" href=\"http://www.beckiebookworm.com\"\u003ewww.beckiebookworm.com\u003c/a\u003e","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2YN73LS21CI1A\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4TA1hhKj-lvGUB6j\"}}"},"likeCount":7,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:97546350":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":97546350,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1637764251i/97546350._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":2333,"textReviewsCount":1330,"name":"Giorgia Reads","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/97546350-giorgia-reads","contributor":null,"id":97546350},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3QRODPJOXJHJQ":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3QRODPJOXJHJQ"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3QRODPJOXJHJQ\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4TA1hhKj-lvGUB6j\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3QRODPJOXJHJQ","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3QRODPJOXJHJQ"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4TA1hhKj-lvGUB6j","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4TA1hhKj-lvGUB6j"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/97546350?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"2022-reads","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/97546350?shelf=2022-reads"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"dark-themes","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/97546350?shelf=dark-themes"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"mafia-criminals","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/97546350?shelf=mafia-criminals"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"alien-romance","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/97546350?shelf=alien-romance"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"paranormal-romance","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/97546350?shelf=paranormal-romance"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"fated-mates","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/97546350?shelf=fated-mates"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4927521055"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.z2Y7Cmk_vNskq_Rn0kxgmg":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.z2Y7Cmk_vNskq_Rn0kxgmg","creator":{"__ref":"User:97546350"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1686885422789,"createdAt":1660820927554,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1660820927554,"text":"\u003cb\u003e3.5 stars \u003c/b\u003e \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIt wasn’t as exciting as I thought it would be and as some reviewers pointed out, this could get/did get quite slow and boring at times \u003cb\u003ebut \u003c/b\u003efor me it was the perfect in the sense that the hero was great. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI don’t read omegaverse and I don’t read dark romance where the relationship between the two leads is dark. The thing is, I love dark romance but mostly what that means in this genre is that there is cnc, dub con, humiliating scenes, control/punishment type of situations etc, and I’d rather drink bleach than read about a “love story” like that. Ok, so having said that, I always look for dark stories where the element of darkness is outside the main relationship and this was one of them. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe hero was absolutely great and totally devoted to the heroine once he met her. Out of all the brothers he was the most quiet, reserved and emotionless one which makes his actions here even more telling. He appreciated the heroine for everything she was and he listened to her ideas, her plans etc. - I know it sounds like bare minimum but within the fiction world of this book, women are not seen or heard unless they need to be used for something. That’s literally how every man (father, brother, stranger) treats women so the fact that the hero doesn’t even contemplate his status as a man against her as a woman does give him a lot of points. Compared to the first book and the first hero this was great. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI do have one complaint thought. I have read and will read a lot of romance books with crude language and it doesn’t bother me. At all. I like the directness of it. But here, the language used goes beyond crude. And it’s like that in all 3 books. To be honest it’s gross. The same things can be said a little different, without censure but also without making me cringe while reading.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAnyway, I read the 3rd book by this point as well. And it’s very much like this one as opposed to being like the 1st one. ","rating":3,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3QRODPJOXJHJQ\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4TA1hhKj-lvGUB6j\"}}"},"likeCount":7,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":2},"User:17871000":{"__typename"