name":"omegaverse","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/10209236?shelf=omegaverse"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"fated-mates","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/10209236?shelf=fated-mates"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4059630318"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.e7_SUNyLIF584vbG8-l9vg":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.e7_SUNyLIF584vbG8-l9vg","creator":{"__ref":"User:10209236"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1624811550803,"createdAt":1623873754721,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1624030253556,"text":"I love returning to this dark mafia world with the large and in charge Alpha males!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eMaxheim Skolov is known as the fix-it, controlled, detached brother. That was before he met his fated mate, Tess. While Maxheim is dominant to the core, he's also caring, considerate, and totally sweet, when he's not rutting, but really he's the total alpha package!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eMaxheim needs to be on his toes because his omega gives him a run for his money. She is everything he needs, the perfect prime omega to stand by his side, but she will push every boundary he sets for her and he wouldn't want it any other way.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eTess has been a slave for most of her life. While she understands the omega way of life, she also doesn't want to put Maxheim or his family's life in jeopardy because of where she came from and what she's done. Tess isn't willing to just roll over and lie down, for the most part, but everytime she pushes back it's like catnip to her alpha. Everyone in the omegaverse is after her and while she wants to do the right thing, Maxheim only wants to protect her and what's his.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eSpending time with the Skolov family gave me all the feels with lots of giddy happiness. Bonding between the two oldest brothers, now that they have something in common was fantastic, while still witnessing the two younger brothers enjoying their bachelorhood in pure naive fun was humorous. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAimes has this world set up to perfection and returning is pure enjoyment at this point. I can hardly wait to see what's next for this family and for the continued adventure.   ","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A17G64B1NBQVVW\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4TA1hhKj-lvGUB6j\"}}"},"likeCount":4,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:8488858":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":8488858,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1499996822i/8488858._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":22,"textReviewsCount":843,"name":"thehotmesslibrary","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/8488858-thehotmesslibrary","contributor":null,"id":8488858},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1Q90T77J0MRT7":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1Q90T77J0MRT7"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1Q90T77J0MRT7\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4TA1hhKj-lvGUB6j\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1Q90T77J0MRT7","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1Q90T77J0MRT7"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4TA1hhKj-lvGUB6j","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4TA1hhKj-lvGUB6j"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/8488858?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4054126846"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.eGaABn3881XgOzlUoRGBxw":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.eGaABn3881XgOzlUoRGBxw","creator":{"__ref":"User:8488858"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1624315101492,"createdAt":1623917254424,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1623917274201,"text":"Savage Prince is book 2 in the Ruthless Warlords series by Alison Aimes and boy is it a scorching hot read. Alpha mafia royalty Maxheim Skolov is on the hunt for the person who kidnapped his twin siblings. Whilst on a mission he comes across Omega, Tess who is in a nightmare situation. Captured and forced to submit with her ‘special’ gift, she is making a lot of enemies and not everything is what it seems. Friends become enemies and both Max and Tess are thrown into the middle of it as they try to overcome their mating bonds, whilst trying to survive in a harsh and violent world.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eMax was a really strong alpha and from the get-go, we see what he is willing to do for his family. Even with the introduction to Tess, he still has a plan to get his family back, although sometimes this is detrimental to him listening to what Tess wants and just steamrolling over her. Tess is a wonderful character who has been through so much. She is vulnerable but strong and even when truths come to light, she still keeps on fighting. Her attraction to Max may be instantaneous, but she isn’t going to let him dominate her…at least not too much!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis series reminds me a little bit of Lora Leigh’s Breed series and it is certainly as hot as them. Savage Prince kind of has everything that you would want in a book, actions, intrigue and red hot passion that leaves you wanting to mop your brow. The story was good and kept you wanting to turn the pages. I wouldn’t normally go for alien/mafia/omega-verse books, but this one was definitely good and made me want to continue reading the series. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eARC received for a fair, honest and sometimes long review. All opinions are my own. 😊\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eMore of my reviews can be found on my blog: \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" href=\"http://thehotmesslibrary.blogspot.com\"\u003ehttp://thehotmesslibrary.blogspot.com\u003c/a\u003e","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1Q90T77J0MRT7\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4TA1hhKj-lvGUB6j\"}}"},"likeCount":3,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:90461064":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":90461064,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1707033958i/90461064._UX200_CR0,122,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":16,"textReviewsCount":357,"name":"✏️Bellas","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/90461064-bellas","contributor":null,"id":90461064},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AJEBST397I128":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AJEBST397I128"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AJEBST397I128\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4TA1hhKj-lvGUB6j\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AJEBST397I128","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AJEBST397I128"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4TA1hhKj-lvGUB6j","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.4TA1hhKj-lvGUB6j"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/90461064?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3915020842"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.N5doRLZWiXPt8ZYpAA1XDg":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.N5doRLZWiXPt8ZYpAA1XDg","creator":{"__ref":"User:90461064"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1629868869719,"createdAt":1629712964901,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1629849084230,"text":"W